<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun a land operation against cartels inside Ecuador while President Noboa asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid and met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation. Noboa rejected claims that former vice president Jorge Glas was tortured, saying his injuries were self-inflicted. Journalist Omar Toledo was shot by motorcycle gunmen and Commander Willy, a fugitive gang boss, was arrested at a hotel in Sitges and deported from Spain. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOdnVKSVpRWlhpLUFqY29EMHlzTE5Qc01UWWxuQ3FSTUtDUXFmZnpXSXZwQlJocmFtNnRpVFJyN3I3UHB4SGVVX2hCcDFHTTc3QnAxWFRRdWdpbWR2VWtoZzNKbmxtcllXaGVFa0tiTXZCaWZVN2szb3VRbHRwTkpOeDI4bjBnMVY5WUFUeHByaG16MmliVUg2U0tnSWROWDJK?oc=5&quot;&gt;Progressive International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOVEZsYk9fWHBPQ29NU2VCc3JOY0E3UWMtbzFCdDdpWGViYjlRVHk2UGlVR1FsZkJqQWhUNElRdEVBSHBLenV2ZnpzRExoSmNJR3NfUVRuZXhUcjRycHZWNGVsZGliRXFSNzBYODVPbms3ckpNWVpONVFrMm5TZXdsS2NDblFJbDQ1dWN1Mk5ZUU5LUnlHMlZzVGJHREk4ekx5YVBQVVU1cGYxOW9hblRtanRn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPSUZhMFlRSHU5bDhZeTNhQ0pmLXFZLTd5cnMzUllxNko4TllLMGItaXgySl90RFBDQUM1UTBBbVR6dERHcTNRTG8wb2RKX1JscXJZMTlJcjVfc09BZkYzQWxXdUhmUF9OSW1EazBHM1VWdjJ6VktIUG5xWU5kWENKWFdNTHhsV2ZOMTRKMUFhanphWWw4V3FQQ0lBTGc1TkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;InSight Crime&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOM0kxbWMyNTJxMGlaajhYZ1FKYm4zNzRONndJTG1Na3c5am5EMm5jNGwyWnYwc0VBYUo2U3dTSXlES3FfNmlFbHpZeWxDVzg3SVdKYkdYbnRLTHVPVEJrSnFWbmNtVWozZngzb0N2ZkZYYl9jVElkbG5fdW43Y